flowchart TD
  Start([User opens AI chat]) --> LoggedIn{Clerk session?}

  LoggedIn -->|No| AskLogin["AI: Please log in to your account first. - Show Log in button"]
  AskLogin --> Clerk["Clerk sign-in"]
  Clerk --> Start

  LoggedIn -->|Yes| LoadCtx["Load Convex user - email / phone / name / branch"]
  LoadCtx --> HasProfile{Email + phone on file?}

  HasProfile -->|Missing| Collect["AI asks: - confirm email & phone"]
  Collect --> Save["users.updateProfile"]
  Save --> Ready

  HasProfile -->|Yes| Ready[AI ready - personalized greeting - Hey firstName, how can I help?]

  Ready --> Intent{User message}
  Intent -->|Order status| Track["Query myOrders + - latest active order"]
  Track --> Reply1["AI explains status - pending / preparing / ready"]
  Intent -->|Menu / hours| Reply2["RAG or branch data - from Convex / content"]
  Intent -->|Other| Reply3["GROQ general reply - with user context in system prompt"]

  subgraph proactive [Proactive - planned]
    AdminReady["Admin sets order to ready"] --> Push["Convex mutation hook"]
    Push --> GroqMsg["GROQ formats friendly line"]
    GroqMsg --> PopCust["Popup + chat message: - Hey Name, your order X is ready!"]
  end
